<title>USA: Carson sees flat Q1 sales.</title>
<headline>Carson sees flat Q1 sales.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Ga. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carson Inc said it expects its first quarter sales to be &quot;essentially flat&quot; compared to the same period last year.</p>
<p>Last year's first quarter results were not immediately available since the company launched its initial public offering in October.</p>
<p>Carson said the expected shortfall is due to a decline in domestic ethnic hair care sales. International sales, however, continued to show substantial growth, the company said.</p>
<p>Carson dropped 3-1/4 to 8-1/8 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
